### =========================================================
###  TBox Restrictions & Disjointness Axioms
### =========================================================

### Axiom: AX_0000  [owl:maxCardinality]
# BufferAccount hasBufferAccountLossLimitation max 500 MonetaryAmount
ins:BufferAccount
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:BufferAccountLossLimitation ;
        owl:maxCardinality "500"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Limits maximum loss absorbed by buffer account. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies a 5% reduction in segment value when S&P 500 declines by 15%, which aligns with a loss cap of 500 units. T…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0001  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# Premium hasPremiumAdjustmentTimingConstraint some TimePeriod
ins:Premium
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:PremiumAdjustmentTimingConstraint ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:TimePeriod
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Specifies when premium adjustments may occur. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows adjustments occur at policy anniversaries or prospectively after approval, indicating a temporal constraint. The…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0002  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# Rider hasRiderTerminationOnLifeEvent some Rider
ins:Rider
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:RiderTerminationOnLifeEvent ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:Rider
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Rider terminates upon life events like divorce. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows riders terminate upon divorce or death, indicating a life event triggers termination. The property links a rid…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0003  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# CostOfInsurance hasCOIChargeExceedsCreditedInterest some MonetaryAmount
ins:CostOfInsurance
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:COIChargeExceedsCreditedInterest ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:MonetaryAmount
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "COI charges exceed credited interest. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states COI charges exceed credited interest in advanced ages, indicating a comparative relationship. The property is a conditi…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0004  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# PolicyLoan hasCashSurrenderValueOnLapseProhibition some MonetaryAmount
ins:PolicyLoan
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:CashSurrenderValueOnLapseProhibition ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:MonetaryAmount
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "No cash surrender value on policy lapse. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states there is no cash value or surrender value upon lapse, indicating a prohibition. The property is tied to a monetary o…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0005  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# AcceleratedBenefit hasAcceleratedBenefitEligibilityCondition some MedicalCriterionForAcceleration
ins:AcceleratedBenefit
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
