        owl:someValuesFrom ins:MedicalCriterionForAcceleration
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Conditions for accelerated benefit eligibility. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies eligibility based on terminal or chronic conditions, which are medical criteria. The property links the be…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0006  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# Policyholder hasConversionPrivilegeEligibility some ConversionEligibility
ins:Policyholder
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:ConversionPrivilegeEligibility ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:ConversionEligibility
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Specifies conditions for policyholder conversion rights. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows conversion privileges are tied to eligibility conditions for policyholders, with clear links to 'Conv…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0007  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# PersonalInformation hasPolicySuspensionOnSanctionedRelocation some PolicySuspension
ins:PersonalInformation
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:PolicySuspensionOnSanctionedRelocation ;
